e bet of around 300-400 chips, I can:\n1. Charge potential flush or straight draws\n2. Extract value if they have a weaker pair\n3. Not overcommit my stack with just one pair\n4. Maintain my chip lead while protecting against being outdrawn\n\nChecking is too passive given I showed strength on the flop and could give free cards to dangerous draws (flush draws especially with two hearts and two diamonds on board).\n\nAnswer: 350"}
