d I might win at showdown.\n\n**Reason:**\nI should **check**. My two pair (9s and 6s) is vulnerable to many hands. The opponent's passive play suggests either weakness or a medium-strength hand. By checking, I:\n1. Avoid putting more chips at risk with a marginal hand\n2. Get to showdown for free\n3. Can still win against weaker holdings like pocket 2s-5s, or if opponent was drawing and missed\n\nBetting would be risky because I'd likely only get called by better hands, and worse hands would fold.\n\n**Answer:** 0"}
